Description: OSINT tool for username and email searches across 600+ platforms
 Blackbird is a powerful OSINT tool that combines fast username and email
 searches with free AI-powered profiling. It includes smart filters,
 PDF/CSV exports, and fully automated analysis from a single CLI.
